  <title>NPU Workload Cooling Needs</title> 
  <body> 
	 <p> 
	 <ul id="UL_3D859F75557B4E729133E4984DFDE5A5"> 
		<li id="LI_335AB2A2077442AAB278551764B0564D"> The table below shows cooling needs for a NPU workload. 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_04137CE86C2D497BA493CB0D6450BDBC"> Note that for sizing the heat exchanger on T_sensor limited systems, the lowest thermal resistance cooling need is the dominant recommended target. 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_17558392577F4327A617C34006DF5D13"> NVL SKUs could have cases where the NPU-centric workload has more stringent cooling needs than the Reference IA MT workloads. 
		</li> 
	 </ul> 
	 </p> 
